-- ============================================================
-- roc1: this part's cases seat text, unchanged (merged by concatenation)
-- ============================================================
-- CASES for roc1-seat.l4: the questions a party to a civil action would ask about Orders 2 to 8 of the Rules of Court 2021.
-- Every expected value is written from the text beside the assertion, with the facts a real party would state.
-- Dates: 5 Nov 2026 is a Thursday; 11 and 23 Nov 2026 are given as the public holidays in these cases (they are fixtures, not statements that they are holidays).
-- Every assertion is a question of the seat; the assertions written equal the assertions satisfied (see NOTES.md, "check.sh output").


-- Order 2
