-- Order 17, rule 3
-- Under Order 17, rule 3(3), must I draw up the order?
#ASSERT `Under Order 17, rule 3(3), must I draw up the order` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- whether or not the outcome is in the party's favour
#ASSERT `Under Order 17, rule 3(3), must I draw up the order` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

