#ASSERT `Under Order 18, rule 3(1), is the time for my appeal, or my application for permission to appeal, still held back from starting to run` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- costs not yet determined: the bar holds (ruling of 2026-11-05, delegated (d))
