#ASSERT `Under Order 18, rule 3(1), is the time for my appeal, or my application for permission to appeal, still held back from starting to run` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- a written law or paragraph (1A) or (2) provides otherwise (ruling of 2026-11-05, delegated (d))

