#ASSERT `Under Order 18, rule 9(3), may the appellate Court restore my appeal for rehearing after I was absent` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- no good reason shown: a requirement of the paragraph is not met

-- Order 18, rule 12
