#ASSERT `Under Order 18, rule 12(1), may I withdraw my appeal or application` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Order 18, rule 12(1), may I withdraw my appeal or application` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- already heard or dealt with
#ASSERT `Under Order 18, rule 12(1), may I withdraw my appeal or application` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- no Form 34 filed and served: the paragraph names that manner only by "by"

-- Order 18, rule 15
