-- Her cousin served the notice on 18 November 2025, one day late: the text fixes the period in its own words, so the answer is no.
#ASSERT `Under Order 16, rule 2(1), may I, as the claimant, discontinue the action or withdraw a claim without the permission of the Court` TRUE TRUE (Date 18 11 2025) (Date 17 11 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A claimant who has served no notice in Form 32: the paragraph is silent on that case, which is not a no.
#ASSERT `Under Order 16, rule 2(1), may I, as the claimant, discontinue the action or withdraw a claim without the permission of the Court` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 17 11 2025) EQUALS NOTHING

