-- Had the Court otherwise ordered, the appeal would not be deemed withdrawn.
#ASSERT `Under Order 18, rule 21(12), is my appeal deemed withdrawn because I did not file my written submissions in time` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- Imran is a defendant.  At the conclusion of the claimant's case he wants to submit No case to answer, but he will call his own witnesses if the Court rules against him: the submission is made on the basis that the defendant will not give evidence, so he is outside it.
#ASSERT `Under Order 15, rule 8(11), may I, as the defendant, make a submission of No case to answer` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
