-- The appellant attended.
#ASSERT `Under Order 19, rule 8(1), may my appeal be dismissed because I did not attend` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Only the solicitor attended.
#ASSERT `Under Order 19, rule 8(1), may my appeal be dismissed because I did not attend` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The appellant attended and no respondent or solicitor for a respondent did.
