#ASSERT `Under Order 19, rule 11(1), may the Court record our consent judgment or order without our attending` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- They have not: the "where" is not met.
#ASSERT `Under Order 19, rule 11(1), may the Court record our consent judgment or order without our attending` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A further order incidental or consequential to a judgment or order.
