-- ===== Rule 12 -- judgment =====
-- Orally at the conclusion of the hearing: paragraph (1)(a).
#ASSERT `Under Order 19, rule 12(1), may the appellate Court give its decision in this way` `o 19 r 12(1)(a) orally at the conclusion of the hearing` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Orally at a later date: paragraph (1)(a).
