-- In writing at a later date: paragraph (1)(b).
#ASSERT `Under Order 19, rule 12(1), may the appellate Court give its decision in this way` `o 19 r 12(1)(b) in writing at a subsequent date` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- In another way: the paragraph names two ways without saying "only".
