#ASSERT `Under Order 56, rule 2(3), may the Court make the order in an action against partners` TRUE TRUE FALSE `o 56 r 2(1)(a) an order in Form 84 to provide a statement of the names and places of residence of the partners and to verify it` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- r 2(3): the Form 84 order
