#ASSERT `Under Order 56, rule 3(3), was the person given the written notice in Form 85 as the person must be` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- r 3(3): no notice: a bare "must"
#ASSERT `Under Order 56, rule 3(3), is the person deemed to be served as a partner` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- r 3(3): "to whom no such notice is given"
#ASSERT `Under Order 56, rule 3(3), is the person deemed to be served as a partner` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- r 3(3): a notice was given
