#ASSERT `Under Order 56, rule 5(4), may the party apply to the Court for permission to apply for an enforcement order against the person` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- r 5(4): judgment, member claimed, paragraphs (1) to (3) do not apply
