#ASSERT `Under Order 64, rule 3, does the rule on serving foreign process otherwise than on a letter of request apply to this process` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- the process is not for civil proceedings before a foreign tribunal

