#ASSERT `Under Order 69, rule 4(1), have I served my application and affidavit as the rule requires` TRUE `o 69 r 1(b) an extended civil restraint order` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- served on every intended defendant and on the Attorney-General
#ASSERT `Under Order 69, rule 4(1), have I served my application and affidavit as the rule requires` TRUE `o 69 r 1(a) a limited civil restraint order` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- the duty does not arise for a limited order

